Why AGPL-3.0?
SarkariPrep is built to remove coaching paywalls for Indian government exam aspirants.
Under AGPL-3.0, any organization or individual who runs a modified version of SarkariPrep
as a network/hosted service MUST also make the complete source code of their modified
version freely available under AGPL-3.0. This prevents commercial coaching platforms
from cloning this repository, closing the source, and placing public question papers
behind a paywall.

(Note: Maintainers may optionally dual-license or switch to MIT if maximum permissive
remixing is preferred — see docs/decisions/001-tech-stack-and-license.md).
